Backend Implementation Plan (Phased)

Note: Supabase is the chosen DB host for this plan.
Maintenance: Update this planB file as tasks are completed or changed so all agents stay in sync.

Transport decision: Start with Server Actions, but keep all business logic in a server-only service layer (no DB logic inside actions). This makes it easy to add Route Handlers + fetch later without refactors. Server Actions are just the first transport, not the permanent API.

